    let _ = py_str("Family, parenting, friends and relationships: everyday advice, kept as data.\n\nThe answers lane owns this domain. One Entry per situation people bring up (a child\nstarting secondary school, a friend who forgot a birthday, a toddler's tantrum), keyed\nby the meaning words that identify it and phrased the way a sensible friend would put\nit: the practical thing first, then the detail that makes it work.\n\nThe matcher in bot/knowledge/lookup.py finds the entry; bot/modules/answers.py answers.\nKeys are deliberately narrow: a line that only mentions a child or a friend in passing\ndoes not score MIN_SCORE, so it falls through instead of getting advice it never asked\nfor. Nothing here diagnoses anyone: where something may need a professional (a child who\nstops eating or sleeping, a relationship that is unsafe), the reply says so and points\nthat way.\n");
